cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Free LLM API Hub — a continuously-verified dataset of free-tier and trial-credit LLM APIs"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it and link back to the repository."
type: dataset
authors:
  - alias: pacocartones
    website: "https://github.com/pacocartones"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pacocartones/free-llm-api-hub"
url: "https://freellmapihub.com/"
abstract: >-
  A curated, continuously-verified dataset of LLM API providers offering a free
  tier, permanently-free models, or trial credits for developers. Every entry is
  dated, sourced to the provider's own documentation, and machine-readable via a
  JSON dataset validated against a published schema.
keywords:
  - free llm api
  - llm api
  - free tier
  - trial credits
  - ai api
  - developer tools
  - openai-compatible
  - dataset
license: MIT
version: "2.3.0"
date-released: "2026-07-30"
